# =========================
# Screenshots / assets
# =========================
# Ignore stray captures but keep the ones the README shows. Note the directory itself
# must stay un-ignored (`screenshots/*`, not `screenshots/`) — git can't re-include a
# file whose parent directory is excluded.
screenshots/*
!screenshots/*.png
!screenshots/appstore/
screenshots/appstore/*
!screenshots/appstore/*.png

